# Testing

## Backend

- Projects: `backend-core/tests/Tests` and `backend-core/src/Tests/UnitTests` (both in `VoiceCallApp.sln`).
- Stack: xUnit, Moq; FluentAssertions in `src/Tests/UnitTests`.
- Prefer handler unit tests with mocked repositories; repository/integration tests may use EF InMemory.
- Run: `dotnet test VoiceCallApp.sln` from `backend-core/`.
- CI runs tests with `continue-on-error: true` — still keep them green when you touch covered code.

## Python AI

- Location: `chat-ai-module/tests/`.
- Run: `pytest tests/ -v` from `chat-ai-module/`.

## Frontends

- No first-class unit-test scripts in `package.json` today.
- Validate with `npm run lint` and `npm run build` when changing UI/contracts.
- Do not add Jest/Vitest/Playwright scaffolding unless the user requests it.

## Guidance

- Add tests next to the style of neighboring test files.
- Cover authz-sensitive and CQRS handler edge cases when changing them.
- Do not require live Postgres/Ollama for unit tests unless explicitly building integration tests.
